m/godotengine/godot/pull/123636","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123636.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123636.patch","merged_at":"2026-09-22T15:21:21Z"},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Changes `TTRN()` usage in the Theme editor\r\nTTRN is usually used with `vformat()`, with `%d` placeholders. Theme editor was using `format()` with `{num}` placeholders, and notably, the singular messages had hard-coded `1`. While it's not completely wrong (thanks to `format()` making placeholders optional), it was a weird outlier.\r\n\r\n- Fixes columns and type names not translated in item import tree\r\nThe Tree had disabled auto-translation. Since there is no separate auto-translation for column titles, I instead made the items disable the translation.\r\n\r\n- Adds monospace font to theme item names\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1516\" height=\"559\" alt=\"img-2026-09-19 16 16 06\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/12c61823-6373-4e53-9bda-7b390c5e8a7d\" />","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/r